{"articleNo":"71833","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=71833&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[12.13]2012 겨울계절수업 수강료 추가 납부일 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.12.11","hit":"5947","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"view_content\" id=\"view_content\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2012 겨울계절수업 수강료 추가 납부일 안내</font></span></strong></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 겨울계절수업 납부기간(12.7 - 12.11)에 수강료를 납부하지 못한 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">추가 납부기간에 <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">필히</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">납부하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. 납부대상 : 수강료를 납부하지 못한 학생</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>추가납부기간 : <font color=\"#cc3d3d\">12.13(목) 오전 9시 - 오후 5시 은행마감시간까지, 1일간</font></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (★미납시 수강신청 내역 삭제)</font></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong><font color=\"#000000\">◐ 고지서출력 : <strong>원스톱서비스-학사관리-등록-등록금고지내역조회/출력</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>(12.13(목) 당일 고지서 출력 가능)</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 금액 : 학점당 25,000원(2학점 강좌 50,000원, 3학점 강좌 75,000원)</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">등록금납부 방법</font></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>■ <strong>개인별 가상계좌번호로&nbsp;수강료 납부/입금</strong>(인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 등 이용시)</font></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;- 받는 사람 이름을(학생본인이름) 필히 확인</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">(보호자 통장으로 이체 가능)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 가상계좌번호는 매학기마다 변경될 수 있습니다.</span></span></span><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">- 본인 원스톱서비스에서 가상계좌확인 후 납부 </font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">해당 납부 기간내 반드시 납부(은행마감시간 참조)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">-</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> 타 부서 계좌 입금(경리팀계좌, 국제교류교육원계좌, 기획협력처계좌 등)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;및 원스톱서비스 본인 환불계좌 입금시 수강인정 불허</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">-</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> 납부 확인 방법 : &nbsp;수강료 납부한 다음날 10:00부터 확인 가능</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 원스톱서비스-학사관리-등록-등록금납부/반환내역조회</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
